ądamy, czego słuchamy, w co się ubieramy i jak myślimy.  Wszyscy odpowiedzą na jedno przewrotne i intrygujące pytanie: dlaczego jesteście kreatywni? Poznamy odpowiedzi inspirujące, niektóre być może szokujące, ale też takie, które potrafią odmienić życie. Połączone stworzą fascynujący portret kilku pokoleń najbardziej wpływowych ludzi świata, zawarty w jednym z najbardziej oryginalnych filmów ostatnich lat.","popularity":1.949,"poster_path":"/qXyYf6scdXweVjiPCyKYjPLKHN8.jpg","release_date":"2018-09-07","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.475,"vote_count":20,"character":"Self","credit_id":"67ff6b92d8b85eb782d956d6","order":11},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mFj4fHscnOd5EIqbC8xEloixrtQ.jpg","genre_ids":[10752,36,99],"id":1476406,"title":"Die Schlüssel zur Freiheit","original_language":"de","original_title":"Die Schlüssel zur Freiheit","overview":"","popularity":0.9769,"poster_path":"/3Ov32ODsAO5cxpkhdHyQcuJCtO.jpg","release_date":"2025-05-05","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Wim Wenders","credit_id":"6819d18878d4e45885c379a5","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/nW3dC7at5ZfDKjWNyXwa4iyEFNS.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":1493717,"title":"A Weekend at the Beach","original_language":"en","original_title":"A Weekend at the Beach","overview":"","popularity":1.179,"poster_path":"/deNK0PvEfyqOu2EJ5wZVYN0P7IZ.jpg","release_date":"2015-12-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Self","credit_id":"6842e8c12cb7a94dcffcbe97","order":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/h2LsSToMcLDRwc4cxuLl9TPRX7Q.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":1423984,"title":"The Ozu Diaries","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Ozu Diaries","overview":"","popularity":0.6378,"poster_path":"/hNfmTq2zaU03gHlg6tBZWcMVcci.jpg","release_date":"2025-09-02","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Self","credit_id":"687fa1726c0df3da9b16a790","order":1},{"adult":false,"backdro